**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.tfstate*
**/*.tfvars
**/.terraform
**/node_modules
**/build
**/.gradle
web/dist
web/src/generated
_bmad-output
orchestrator/.venv
infra
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/.claude/settings.local.json
